From 6a93064be514400ae2b683052bf714cf26ad8c77 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tsuji-riya <tsuji.riya@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 01:07:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] nand, spi: add CNC1800L NAND controller and 16-bit
 Designware SPI

Add a DM raw NAND driver for the Celestial CNC1800L. ECC follows the
standard NAND DT properties: default is the SoC 1-bit Hamming engine in
the vendor on-flash format, nand-ecc-mode = "soft" selects software BCH.
Let the Designware SPI driver use 16 bit register accesses
(reg-io-width = <2>) and enable SPI NOR and NAND commands, with a second
board DTS/defconfig using generic ECC.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01K1YEf8BfFQRcvUTgm7e5vZ
